                                           rdfs:label "has manufacturer"@en .


###  http://purl.example.com/aircraft/0000027
<http://purl.example.com/aircraft/0000027> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                           rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topObjectProperty ;
                                           rdfs:domain <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000958> ;
                                           <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0443-3036> ;
                                           <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> "2026-09-10T17:49:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
                                           rdfs:label "is about"@en ;
                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A relation between an Information Content Entity and an Entity, in which the Information Content Entity carries information concerning that Entity." .


